  "body": "## What's Changed\n* feat: optional tui feature and minimal router release binaries by @tioan in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/311\n* build(deps): bump the rust-dependencies group with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/313\n* build(deps): bump taiki-e/install-action from 2.88.0 to 2.90.1 in the github-actions group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/312\n* fix: QUIC IPv4 bind, PSK MTU probe, mapped-IP ACL/rate-limit, and Prometheus TCP_INFO by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/314\n* fix: CLI log-file/max-duration/precedence, TUI settings/theme/elapsed, diff, and -o preflight by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/315\n* docs, ci: add aarch64-minimal cross-smoke, deduplicate changelog, and refresh docs by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/316\n* fix: honour Ctrl-C during connect and handshake by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/318\n* fix: handshake UTF-8 reads, probe-mtu config bitrate, and test coverage by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/319\n* fix: keep bidir send TCP_INFO when the receive half fails by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/317\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/lance0/xfr/compare/v0.14.1...v0.15.0",
